      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><em>Dark Wings, Gleaming Gems (Loot Tavern hunt, APL 5/10/15)</em></p><h2>Harvest Table</h2><table><thead><tr><th>DC</th><th>Components</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5</td><td>Jinn: Eye (2); Griffon: Eye (2)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Jinn: Primordial Dust (2); Griffon: Primordial Dust (2)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Jinn: Bone (10); Griffon: Bone (10)</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>Jinn: Timeshards (10); Griffon: Smokeglass (10)</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>Jinn: Volatile Mote of Earth (2); Griffon: Volatile Mote of Earth (2)</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>Jinn: Elemental Core of Earth (1, no check needed if the Amalgam unfuses); Griffon: Elemental Core of Earth (1)</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Craftable Items</h2><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.Q7kS6WpnhWEBY6y0]{Blow-By Bellows (Uncommon)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.C0gcE0xfXrQtf5mB]{Grasp of Reality (Uncommon)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.FuOTBSE1AYvwFaFu]{Grasp of Reality (Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.ZekmHoAKmJ1LV3XP]{Grasp of Reality (Very Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.zYujZsOHuZz2MJ8z]{Spacetime Stabiliser (Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.YdV0N3VQmiBm6nrb]{Spatial Plumeshield (Uncommon)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.KL6tMQmb0E6pnwFH]{Spatial Plumeshield (Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.58sTDUyvqJcVMYpV]{Spatial Plumeshield (Very Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.Cr3AKZ2lR3YyZdr0]{Temporal Shardspear (Uncommon)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.qwEM2BIodejtYLsD]{Temporal Shardspear (Rare)}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.hunt-items.Item.vMd6Mb1BRQGg05cA]{Temporal Shardspear (Very Rare)}</p>"
